[{"title":"挽戴隐居","author":"释宗泐","text":"仲夏初相别，何知异死生。\n艰难十日会，感激百年情。\n岩穴无遗佚，交游失老成。\n忍将刍一束，脉脉对铭旌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57740,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪涨","author":"释宗泐","text":"晓起闻溪涨，披衣立小轩。\n混茫初学海，澒洞欲包原。\n光撼山根动，声吹地轴翻。\n群童不晓事，喧噪傍沙痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57741,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈检校见过","author":"释宗泐","text":"何来凤池客，著屐到岩阿。\n溪雨晓初歇，山花开正多。\n道逢方外合，诗爱静中哦。\n寂寞禅房晚，疏钟出薜萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57742,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重答夏本心","author":"释宗泐","text":"有约何曾至，无期却自来。\n暖怜沙上日，清爱竹边梅。\n山鸟当琴几，溪云对茗杯。\n桓公遗庙近，乘兴一追陪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57743,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞山泉为谐舜咨赋","author":"释宗泐","text":"此水何年有，潇潇日夜声。\n不教人外见，偏向洞中鸣。\n客思初无睡，禅心自不惊。\n休论为世用，且作在山清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57744,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栎山西斋雨中作","author":"释宗泐","text":"疏雨过高峰，幽斋对碧松。\n出山云似马，落涧水如龙。\n句向静中得，身于僻处慵。\n小童林下至，报有虎行踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57745,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄汪隐居","author":"释宗泐","text":"茅屋涌溪阿，天寒补薜萝。\n白云当面起，流水绕檐过。\n药老披榛斸，诗成倚树哦。\n因逢邻寺客，为问近如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57746,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"故泾县徐典史挽歌","author":"释宗泐","text":"白发神仙吏，黄尘八十龄。\n竟同华表鹤，俄失老人星。\n瓮尽床头酒，埃生桉上经。\n今朝来哭处，墓草未全青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57747,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送夏景瞻独立有作","author":"释宗泐","text":"溪上送归船，新晴水一川。\n迅流端似马，解缆即如仙。\n野迥村烟直，山高夕照偏。\n此时独立意，都属数声蝉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57748,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一室","author":"释宗泐","text":"一室晚独坐，闭门心境空。\n偶将真意会，却与古人同。\n经架侵窗雨，茶烟趁竹风。\n兴来戛铜椀，未必便为通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57749,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒行","author":"释宗泐","text":"林下可逍遥，閒行意颇超。\n幽花不碍路，偃木自成桥。\n度岭何须屐，㪺泉岂用瓢。\n无媒甘老去，爱尔草萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57750,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送春","author":"释宗泐","text":"忽忽雨中去，独吟相送时。\n忘情从别易，惜老愿归迟。\n花在如怜客，鹃啼欲恨谁。\n明年看到处，知尔更无私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57751,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜王子谦见过","author":"释宗泐","text":"积雨林居僻，俄惊使节临。\n不因今日话，争见古人心。\n疏磬青萝外，流莺碧树阴。\n松门閒不掩，此后更谁寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57752,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"休镊白","author":"释宗泐","text":"休镊髭髯白，从教次第生。\n和风消不得，妙药染难成。\n间竹梅初破，黏松雪半晴。\n今朝閒把镜，稍共鬓毛明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57753,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西阁为修师作","author":"释宗泐","text":"眷兹山阁小，独住一閒僧。\n座冷浮青霭，檐虚挂碧藤。\n禽残瓦钵水，鼠餂夜窗灯。\n爱尔不能懒，时时为一登。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57754,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与徐伯廉再往南陵","author":"释宗泐","text":"又向南陵去，复携良友同。\n人烟千嶂里，客路百花中。\n雉雊初晴日，莺啼满树风。\n渐知精舍近，清磬出林东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57755,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双清士诗","author":"释宗泐","text":"有美双清客，齐名浙省郎。\n两凫相上下，联璧有辉光。\n粉署朝同砚，邮亭夜对床。\n凉风凤池上，羽翮惜分翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57756,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"释宗泐","text":"纨素不盈尺，写成千嶂图。\n松杉开阆苑，楼观涌玄都。\n瑶草如堪拾，黄猿不受呼。\n群仙相次坐，许共一僧无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57757,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送玄极归仙居三学寺兼寄固坏庵","author":"释宗泐","text":"昨夜共青灯，今朝下碧层。\n衣沾吴野雪，饭煮越溪冰。\n乡寺居三学，宗门尚一乘。\n故人头向白，送尔思弥增。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57758,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"作诗赠智一真","author":"释宗泐","text":"作诗期必化，化是不凡材。\n龙起天云合，鹏飞海水开。\n具区春泱漭，泰华晓崔嵬。\n试问同禅侣，平生悟几回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57759,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题渔樵图","author":"释宗泐","text":"两客此相遇，百年天与閒。\n泊舟临碧岸，吹笛对青山。\n怪树依岩老，幽花笑日殷。\n画图谁不羡，尘土自摧颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57760,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题弥仲纶澹泊斋","author":"释宗泐","text":"禅斋名澹泊，自可寄閒身。\n席上尘都积，门前草自春。\n寒衣缝野槲，晓饭煮江莼。\n不动区中念，端为世外人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57761,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠立恒中","author":"释宗泐","text":"海外趁商船，江东住几年。\n华音虽已习，乡信若为传。\n一钵随缘饭，诸峰到处禅。\n凉秋明月夜，梦度石桥烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57762,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登多景楼","author":"释宗泐","text":"水际一峰出，飞楼倚泬寥。\n烟云连北土，风物见南朝。\n山势临淮尽，江声入海消。\n偶来閒眺客，凭槛兴偏饶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57763,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘允英还乡","author":"释宗泐","text":"秋风江上起，江水日增波。\n旅服迎寒薄，乡心到夜多。\n吴樯随北雁，海舶听南歌。\n想见伸嘉庆，双亲发尽皤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57764,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王叔润","author":"释宗泐","text":"平凉来又去，官满复之官。\n塞晚黄云合，边秋白草寒。\n有储诸将喜，无讼远人安。\n万里关山月，吟诗独自看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57765,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"窦德远西斋读易诗","author":"释宗泐","text":"西斋读易处，心与静相宜。\n对烛雨凉夜，卷帘天霁时。\n妙观宁有象，至玩本无辞。\n一悟穷通理，陶然坐自怡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57766,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登相国寺楼","author":"释宗泐","text":"冬日大梁城，郊原四望平。\n云开太行碧，霜落蔡河清。\n欲问征西路，兼怀吊古情。\n夷门名尚在，无处觅侯嬴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57767,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过虎牢关","author":"释宗泐","text":"入关登峻坂，出谷见黄河。\n客路车行窄，人家穴处多。\n洛阳当胜槩，嵩岳近嵯峨。\n千古兴亡恨，临风一浩歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57768,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安雪中","author":"释宗泐","text":"岁暮长安道，天寒积雪深。\n凄凉游子意，款曲故人心。\n未遂终南隐，徒怜灞上吟。\n明朝又西去，秦树晚沈沈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57769,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马文德终南别业","author":"释宗泐","text":"别业终南下，屯居异辋川。\n豆生新雨后，禾熟早秋天。\n明月池边酌，凉风树下眠。\n龚黄成底事，青史旧空传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57770,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发扶风","author":"释宗泐","text":"晓发扶风县，云低欲雪时。\n长河王莽寺，独树马超祠。\n营窟炊烟早，牛车度坂迟。\n非熊无复梦，渭水自逶迤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57771,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪岭","author":"释宗泐","text":"华戎分壤处，雪岭白嵯峨。\n万古消不尽，三秋积又多。\n寒光欺夏日，素彩烁天河。\n自笑经过客，相看鬓易皤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57772,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屋舟","author":"释宗泐","text":"吴人舟似屋，今子屋为舟。\n四面水都绕，百年身若浮。\n下临知有地，中坐恐随流。\n梦里天无际，微茫发棹讴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57773,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑公志奉兄骨还乡","author":"释宗泐","text":"昔出为元方，官登吏部郎。\n挈家才食禄，裹骨竟还乡。\n岁暮冰霜白，山空草木黄。\n云边孤雁影，南去海天长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57774,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天华","author":"释宗泐","text":"说法造玄微，天华白昼飞。\n从空方糁糁，似雪又霏霏。\n满座都凝目，何人更著衣。\n梁朝台咫尺，今古共光辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57775,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵咏雪","author":"释宗泐","text":"洒窗疑雨急，投隙信风斜。\n换竹千林色，添梅几树花。\n戏堆朝作兽，满掬夜煎茶。\n乘兴山阴客，能过静者家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57776,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槎峰杂咏六首 其一 芝岩","author":"释宗泐","text":"高岩何壮哉，万古碧崔嵬。\n不是五丁凿，应同一气开。\n灵芝随地有，怪木是谁栽。\n待结茅亭后，时时引客来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57777,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槎峰杂咏六首 其二 南涧","author":"释宗泐","text":"携友过南涧，槎桥类断虹。\n鸟啼青嶂外，麋卧绿阴中。\n僧笠迎秋雨，樵歌落晚风。\n谢公双屐健，独入杏林东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57778,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槎峰杂咏六首 其三 杏坞","author":"释宗泐","text":"山杏何人种，东风满坞花。\n如闻鲁坛曲，或是董仙家。\n谷口千林密，岩前数树斜。\n明春移屋去，住近赤城霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57779,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槎峰杂咏六首 其四 白莲沼","author":"释宗泐","text":"不作虎溪念，开池种白莲。\n但知今日事，宁论昔时贤。\n叠石高为岸，疏渠细引泉。\n看花初日际，玉立净娟娟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57780,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槎峰杂咏六首 其五 对池亭","author":"释宗泐","text":"一亭如瓮大，自可著閒身。\n白首几时客，青山有限人。\n到秋莲实老，得雨芡花新。\n莫谓无心事，朝朝送日轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57781,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槎峰杂咏六首 其六 三老亭","author":"释宗泐","text":"为爱岩栖好，结亭于此间。\n一身同二老，白首得青山。\n破静闻猿断，忘归待鹤还。\n采芝人去后，日莫碧云閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57782,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"深居","author":"释宗泐","text":"山崦入重重，诛茅第几峰。\n四檐青树合，一径白云封。\n夜冷齐腰雪，春阴破额松。\n自来深处住，樵客不相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57783,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送宗法师住慈感","author":"释宗泐","text":"坐惜故人别，年华老渐催。\n冬深不见雪，春近未逢梅。\n船向苕溪去，水从天目来。\n今宗亦寥落，几处讲筵开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57784,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"释宗泐","text":"良工夺化工，随物写形容。\n可怪一尺素，忽生千万峰。\n坞云白冉冉，岩树碧重重。\n忘却是图画，出门携短筇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57785,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张士衡之陜西","author":"释宗泐","text":"故旧今谁在，江花四十春。\n独惭青眼客，相送白头人。\n纱帽新辞阙，单车远入秦。\n广文樗散意，好在酒杯频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57786,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"处梦","author":"释宗泐","text":"处世皆如梦，惟吾识趣閒。\n乾坤同逆旅，日月自循环。\n觅句多临水，支颐或看山。\n庄周与蝴蝶，犹在是非间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57787,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石溪渔隐","author":"释宗泐","text":"乘閒垂钓客，多在石溪中。\n断港孤蓬雪，长堤一笛风。\n沧浪歌濯足，渭水兆非熊。\n好为明时出，休誇隐德隆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57788,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过凤翔","author":"释宗泐","text":"驱车过凤翔，驲路入汧阳。\n地接戎羌远，山连蜀陇长。\n平川将尽处，重谷转荒凉。\n明日关山道，登高望帝乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57789,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵送徐伯廉归南陵","author":"释宗泐","text":"把酒城南道，离怀去住同。\n鸟啼红树里，人出翠微中。\n山雨添秋色，溪云度晚风。\n倚楼相忆处，明月各西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57790,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江风山月堂诗为文起周作","author":"释宗泐","text":"风月堂清绝，江山夜寂寥。\n寒光吟处白，灵籁静中消。\n脉脉照林薄，翛翛送海潮。\n禅心与诗思，何用不超遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57791,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入孤涧有作","author":"释宗泐","text":"谷里何人住，山腰有径通。\n老猿时挂树，好鸟自吟风。\n古涧寒泉碧，连山夕烧红。\n隐居惭未遂，明日片帆东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57792,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝来","author":"释宗泐","text":"朝来暑气清，疏雨过檐楹。\n径竹欹斜处，山禽一两声。\n閒情聊自适，幽事与谁评。\n几上玲珑石，青蒲细细生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57793,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大宁寺喜雨","author":"释宗泐","text":"何处新闻雨，深山古寺中。\n晓声兼蟋蟀，秋意在梧桐。\n已觉人情喜，深知岁事丰。\n山翁病全减，相对笑颜同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57794,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过后山","author":"释宗泐","text":"为惜山程近，行穿石径微。\n藤稍斜刺眼，草子细粘衣。\n废宅人何在，荒林鸟不飞。\n旧游还历历，抚事觉今非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57795,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽居","author":"释宗泐","text":"长夏山中客，幽居爱静便。\n花垂初著雨，树白半笼烟。\n斩竹修瓜架，刳杉引石泉。\n有人知此趣，为尔一欣然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57796,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兀坐","author":"释宗泐","text":"清晓澹无为，空斋兀坐时。\n百年惟有懒，万事不求知。\n松雨晴还滴，茶烟起更垂。\n何人共怡悦，随意独支颐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57797,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中作","author":"释宗泐","text":"山雨暗连村，游人不到门。\n幽居斯道在，黄卷此心存。\n世岂齐常变，吾方一静喧。\n竹禽如解意，相对语前轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57798,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜","author":"释宗泐","text":"沈沈寒夜永，历历禁钟馀。\n空馆三更雪，残灯一卷书。\n禅扉原寂寞，客舍独何如。\n不是忘情者，孤怀讵可舒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57799,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杨子震之夔州府知府","author":"释宗泐","text":"太守之官去，遥遥白帝城。\n江流诸葛阵，山木杜鹃声。\n自古论形势，于今息战争。\n文翁能化蜀，端不负皇情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57800,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题送别图送客","author":"释宗泐","text":"送别长干道，仍题送别图。\n平林带远谷，白鸟下青芜。\n天际帆千幅，沙头酒一壶。\n劳劳亭畔柳，还似渭城无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57801,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵东轩见访","author":"释宗泐","text":"老结淮山屋，重围橡树林。\n鹿行岩径窄，虎饮涧泉深。\n风雨人间事，冰霜世外心。\n夜来明月上，拥毳一长吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57802,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亭南书隐为贡友达作","author":"释宗泐","text":"敬亭南野阔，家世旧云林。\n三亩水边宅，半生灯下心。\n閒依渭叟钓，醉与楚狂吟。\n门外无车马，年年草自深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57803,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵赠太平县姚主簿","author":"释宗泐","text":"龙虎新开国，鸳鸾尽列廷。\n辟书从帅阃，得县次郎星。\n材儗王珣笔，文超崔瑗铭。\n暂时栖枳棘，从此奋青冥。\n旧说酬三语，犹闻究一经。\n陋邦沾美化，疲俗尚轻刑。\n秋水清虚郭，春山紫翠屏。\n冥怀劳簿籍，散步出郊坰。\n薄暮投禅屋，将诗自宪庭。\n来窥麋鹿性，喜识凤凰翎。\n破榻霜苔冷，孤灯夜雨青。\n吾生同槁木，身世即浮萍。\n老去思归浙，年来厌在泾。\n逢君俱越客，矫首望东溟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57804,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"排律诗三十韵奉饯杭州王太守任满朝京","author":"释宗泐","text":"吴甸初宾服，皇威畅海壖。\n钱塘称剧郡，太守选时贤。\n保障东南重，丝纶惠化宣。\n疲民思白日，披雾得青天。\n示俭豪奢革，祛烦疾病痊。\n淳风还大朴，旧俗付新湔。\n清净尹东海，宽明黄颍川。\n论才当第一，奏课合居先。\n汉室符中剖，黄堂席更专。\n两轓朱烜赫，五马烂联翩。\n方伯真荣矣，斯人亦幸焉。\n始终如一日，安集已三年。\n市有新成屋，郊无久秽田。\n湖山青入画，桑柘绿如烟。\n昔在新安治，恭闻异绩骈。\n大州难接武，列郡少随肩。\n棠憩阴初合，瓜期代倏然。\n依刘心耿耿，借寇思绵绵。\n白叟惊相顾，黄童也自怜。\n卧当侯霸辙，挽拥邓攸船。\n趋陛云霄逼，承恩雨露偏。\n赤墀迎气淑，紫服照春妍。\n行献嘉禾颂，归歌湛露篇。\n赐书褒美效，增秩比超迁。\n当路瞻鹏举，临风想旆还。\n梦回江上笛，愁绝雨中鹃。\n谬忝馀波及，都将外物捐。\n茆茨閒日月，钟鼓乐林泉。\n支遁期元度，韩公识大颠。\n试磨苍藓石，遗爱尽堪镌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":57805,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]